nting marketing reporting and KPIs at Group and shareholder level. And you run and assess customer surveys, turning what you learn into decisions we actually act on.<br><br>Gaming is a volatile business, and the classic playbook does not always deliver a straight line to growth. We are all pulling for the same outcome for the wider group, which sometimes means short-term compromises we make together. In practice, that also means staying flexible and genuinely meeting people face to face rather than just online.</span></p><br><strong>What convinces us</strong><p><strong><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">Ideally, you would have:</span></strong><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><br></span><ul><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">a strong, hands-on track record leading holistic marketing departments, from performance marketing to social, community, and creative, backed by solid marketing controlling, budget management, and core KPI skills</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">real performance marketing experience, paired with the ability to genuinely inspire a team toward a shared goal</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">some background in IT or hosting, plus experience working with external agencies and freelancers</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">gaming industry exposure is a nice-to-have, though a genuine feel for gaming culture matters just as much as the industry on your CV</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">some exposure to influencer management or social media marketing, and enough confidence to step into a thought-leader role in the market when needed</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">strong communication skills and a knack for handling conflict head-on, with a strategic, analytical mindset that connects campaigns to business outcomes</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">a proactive, hands-on, reliable way of working, comfortable holding yourself to a high bar under pressure</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">an open, global, adaptable mindset with genuine passion for the product and enough flexibility to compromise when the business needs it</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">fluent German and English</li></ul><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"> <br>If this job offer has sparked your interest, please do reach out to us, even if you only meet some of the requirements. We'd love to get to know each other!</span></p><br><strong>Awesome Prospects</strong><p><ul><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>Make an impact</strong> – Take ownership and be part of one of the most exciting growth stories in the industry</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>Work the way that fits your life</strong> – Remote or hybrid with flexible hours and the setup you need to perform at your best</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>Experience real freedom</strong> – Workation across the EU and in our summer office in Mallorca</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>Stay active and healthy</strong> – Access to EGYM Wellpass and a wide range of fitness and wellness options</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>Dive into real challenges</strong> – Work on a wide range of technical topics that keep things exciting and far from routine</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>Keep growing</strong> – Develop your skills through hands-on experience, knowledge sharing, and continuous learning as 