s of homes.Together. Every day. One home at a time</p><br><strong>Your application process</strong><p><ul><li>Your CV is reviewed by our Talent Acquisition team</li><li>An initial introductory conversation with your Talent Acquisition Manager, Alex</li><li>If we have a suitable open position, we will contact you again about the next steps</li><li>If there is currently no suitable position available, you will become part of the thermondo</li><li>talent pool for future opportunities</li></ul></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/thermondo/working-student-analytics-engineering-berlin-zentrale-375249","tags":["Werkstudent","Student","Working Student"],"job_types":["Student","Intern","Part time"],"location":"Berlin (Zentrale)","created_at":1790788152},{"slug":"werkstudent-technical-support-self-service-berlin-zentrale-431828","company_name":"Thermondo","title":"Werkstudent Technical Support & Self-Service (m/w/d)","description":"<br><strong>Wir suchen</strong><p><span style="color:rgb(32,32,32);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline;">...Dich als </span><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;color:rgb(32,32,32);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);">Werkstudent:in im Bereich Customer Success</strong></span><span style="color:rgb(32,32,32);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,