l Elliptic products. By collaborating across blockchain, intelligence and product teams, you will deliver innovative features that help the world fight financial crime and increase transparency in the crypto space. Very few engineering roles have such clearly measurable real-world impact.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will also help us excel in engineering excellence by mentoring and upskilling our highly-engaged and passionate engineers, by championing best practices, and holding yourself and your team to a high standard.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What you will do</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Write, ship, and maintain production code as a hands-on engineer.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Architect, design, and implement large-scale distributed data systems and pipelines.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute to technical decision-making across batch and streaming data solutions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate with engineers, product managers, data scientists, and intelligence analysts to build customer-focused products.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Explore and integrate new technologies (e.g. data orchestration or cloud-native tools) to optimise performance and scalability.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Take shared ownership of data systems, from design to deployment and ongoing improvement and support.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Perform thoughtful peer reviews that raise code quality and share best practices across the team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute to platform-wide initiatives that improve reliability, observability, and cost efficiency.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help shape the technical roadmap for data engineering across Elliptic.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role requires ‘Adoptive’ AI fluency. This means AI has already changed how you work, not just how fast.