 engineering teams to align on architecture, tooling, and best practices</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build intuitive dashboards and internal applications that allow Finance teams to explore data and manage workflows independently</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Identify AI and automation opportunities, take them from prototype to production, and measure the value they create</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help Finance teams adopt data and AI tools effectively through documentation, training, and day-to-day support</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h1><strong>Profile</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Significant experience in data engineering, analytics engineering, or a closely related role, including ownership of production-grade data solutions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven track record of building or substantially improving a modern data platform or analytics stack</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Highly proficient in SQL and comfortable building production systems in Python</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong software-engineering practices applied to data work: testing, version control, code review, documentation, and monitoring</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Solid understanding of core corporate Finance and accounting concepts; familiarity with French accounting principles is a strong advantage</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to translate ambiguous business needs into clear, pragmatic technical solutions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable working autonomously, prioritising competing needs, and delivering value incrementally</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong communication skills with both technical and non-technical stakeholders, in French and English</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Curious about the evolving data and AI ecosystem — you test new approaches on real problems and form your own point of view</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Rigorous, detail-oriented, and focused on measurable outcomes; pragmatic in technology choices, knowing when to build, adopt open-source, or buy commercial solutions</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Nice to have:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience building tools or data products for Finance teams</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience deploying AI agents or AI-enabled workflows into production</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with the mobile gaming, consumer apps, advertising, or digital analytics ecosystem</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience operating data infrastructure on AWS</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h1><strong>Our Stack</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Cloud:</strong> AWS</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Languages:</strong> Python, SQL, Scala</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Transformation &amp; orchestration:</strong> dbt, Airflow, Spark</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Query engines:</strong> Athena, StarRocks</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Infrastructure:</strong> Terraform, Kubernetes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Internal applications:</strong> Streamlit</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI-assisted development:</strong> Claude Code, MCP-based internal tooling</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h1><strong>Benefits</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive salary based on experience</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Swile Lunch voucher</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Gymlib (100% covered by Voodoo)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Premium healthcare coverage with SideCare, 100% covered for you and your family</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Wellness activities in our Paris office</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Remote Fridays</p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/voodoo/finance-data-engineer-paris-498896","tags":["Corporate"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Paris","created_at":1790786414},{"slug":"game-artist-sand-loop-paris-477719","company_name":"Voodoo","title":"Game Artist - Sand Loop","description":"<h1>About Voodoo</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Voodoo is a consumer tech company founded in Paris in 2013, with one mission: entertain the world. Today we are 1,000 people, generating $1b+ in annual revenue, profitably. Our games and apps have passed 7 billion downloads and reach 200 million+ active users every month, making Voodoo the #3 mobile publisher worldwide in downloads, after Google and Meta. We were backed by Goldman Sachs, Tencent and GBL along the way.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h1>Team</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will be an integral part of a newly established internal studio, a dynamic and focused team dedicated to one of our most promising prototype in scale. This studio is specifically chartered to improve this high-potential game up to the successful and market-ready title it is meant to become. </p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">In this role, you'll work across our puzzle game portfolio, contributing your artistic skills to titles that have already demonstrated strong core mechanics and real player engagement. Puzzle games demand a precise and thoughtful visual language, from clear iconography and satisfying feedback animations to cohesive UI and world aesthetics, and your work will be central to delivering