es of all sizes, serving more than 1M+ members, and have reached €800M+ in ARR.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prevention as the new norm. That's what we're building with our team of 1000+ people. If it speaks to you: we're hiring across France, Spain, Belgium, and Canada. And beyond.</p><h1><strong>Mission</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Alan is scaling internationally (800+ employees, 100+ healthcare professionals, 5+ countries) and needs IT Engineers to build and own the internal technology platform every Alaner works on: identity and provisioning, endpoint and SaaS security, the tooling behind our clinics, and the automation that keeps IT from scaling linearly with headcount.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The scope below is what the team owns, not a checklist for one person. You'll be staffed on one or two of these areas at a time, according to your strengths and interests, and it will evolve through time based on company needs and personal appetite.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Staying close to users keeps us building the right things: you'll spend up to 2-3 days a month on IT support, seeing first-hand where friction lives and what's worth automating next.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>Scope</strong></h1><h3><strong>⚙️ Platform &amp; automation</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own and extend automations on Alan Home, our internal provisioning engine</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain, extend and improve helpdesk automation, SaaS provisioning flows, and onboarding/offboarding pipelines</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the meeting room AV and room-booking platform as a product, replicable across offices</p></li></ul><h3><strong>🔑 Identity &amp; access</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the IT side of the employee lifecycle (onboarding, offboarding, mobility between jobs and countries) across Google Workspace, SSO/SAML and our 