</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Security, Compliance &amp; Audit Support: </strong>Ensuring platform configurations adhere to SonarSource's data protection, access control, and audit requirements. Supporting external audit engagements (KPMG, PwC) with documentation and evidence packages.</p>
