</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Atlassian Certifications (Plus): </strong>ACP-620 (Jira Service Management), ACP-120 (Jira Administrator), or ACP-420 (Confluence Administrator) are highly valued.</p>
</li>

<p><strong>Leadership &amp; Soft Skills</strong></p>

<li>
